   completed_at: '2026-10-01T09:40:55.680364+00:00'
+- id: TJ-DF-040
+  title: 'PyYAML-less fresh host: rule files silently unload -> engine allows everything
+    (fail-open)'
+  criteria:
+  - 'On a host without PyYAML, any .yaml rule file that the JSON fallback cannot parse
+    must NOT contribute zero rules silently: the engine must fail closed (abort load
+    -> blocking bridge-error verdict) and the bridge verdict must state the failure;
+    yaml-only policy must block with PyYAML and refuse-to-allow without it; regression
+    tests pin both arms'
+  status: complete
+  created_at: '2026-10-02T03:10:31.504260+00:00'
+  completed_at: '2026-10-02T04:28:05.787535+00:00'
+- id: INT-CI-2
+  title: 'Coverage tooling: pytest-cov in dev group + CI-reported measured baseline'
+  criteria:
+  - pyproject.toml [dependency-groups].dev includes pytest-cov
+  - uv sync --dev --python 3.11 then .venv/bin/python -m pytest plugin -q --cov=terminal_jail
+    --cov-report=term-missing completes and prints a coverage total for plugin/terminal_jail
+  - The measured coverage number and the exact command are recorded in the repo (README
+    development section)
+  - ci.yml test job installs pytest-cov and runs the coverage step, publishing the
+    total in the job log as an artifact
+  - the coverage floor (--cov-fail-under) is set at or below the measured baseline,
+    with the honest caveats (exclusions) stated where the number is published
+  status: complete
+  created_at: '2026-10-02T07:46:55.680431+00:00'
+  completed_at: '2026-10-02T09:06:58.146804+00:00'
+- id: TJ-DF-043
+  title: Resolve unshare orphan-teardown containment failure (kernel 6.12) or narrow+enforce
+    the backend contract
+  criteria:
+  - '1) Root cause named with kernel citation or minimal reproducer for 6.12 unshare
+    teardown failure. 2) EITHER teardown holds across kernel matrix cells with recorded
+    survival times OR guarantee narrowed+enforced: auto refuses backends whose teardown
+    contract cannot hold, documented in README + --help + docs/backend-parity.md.
+    3) Regression pinned in matrix harness/CI. 4) No weakening of firewall or other
+    containment layers.'
+  status: in_progress
+  created_at: '2026-10-02T15:08:36.573332+00:00'
